  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "lb_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -314
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Layout bloom\n\nLayout places `count` items in a grid, a ring, a phyllotaxis spiral or along a path, and gives each a position, an angle and a scale. When the count, the mode or a grid's `cols` changes (or you edit the node), every item eases to its new place over `duration`: new ones grow in, removed ones shrink away. `stagger` starts later items later.\n\nHere the count steps through a list, 12 → 42 → 72 → 102, every 1.8 s: Time is divided into 1.8 s periods and Lookup (`pick`, which wraps round) reads the list. Switch the mode to `grid` or `ring` and watch the seeds travel.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 250
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Layout bloom\n\nLayout places `count` items in a grid, a ring, a phyllotaxis spiral or along a path, and gives each a position, an angle and a scale. When the count, the mode or a grid's `cols` changes (or you edit the node), every item eases to its new place over `duration`: new ones grow in, removed ones shrink away. `stagger` starts later items later.\n\nHere the count steps through a list, 12 → 42 → 72 → 102, every 1.8 s: Time is divided into 1.8 s periods and Lookup (`pick`, which wraps round) reads the list. Switch the mode to `grid` or `ring` and watch the seeds travel.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 250
      }
    },
